  "notes": "Static table fixture. Diametral clearance c=0.3 mm. The 1 x 30 degree entry is 1 mm axially (Z39-40), radial expansion tan(30) mm. The nominal 3.5 mm seat grows by c/2 to preserve both exact bore diameters. Required collision layout is 48 upper + 48 tapered entry + 48 lower sectors, outer circumradius 31 mm, plus exactly four peripheral boxes (148 total). As mandated by that layout, mounting holes are visual only and the diagonal spaces between the R31 ring and the four boxes are unfilled; central insertion surfaces and seat remain exact. No hull closes the bore. Metres, Z up, front -X, bottom-centre origin, applied transforms and a shared prop frame. Triangulated visual OBJ with normals, 30-degree smoothing, nonoverlapping 66-degree Smart UVs. Albedo: CPU Cycles 64-sample DIFFUSE COLOR * (0.4 + 0.6 * AO), RGB8 sRGB, no direct light or highlights. Full Principled PBR and marking images packed in source.blend. Preview: 1024 square, CPU Cycles 64, neutral grey, three lights, front-left above. Collision coordinates retain 12 decimal places in metres. Simulation may vary instance colour by 0.97-1.03. Suggested worktable position [0.400, 0, 0.800] m; positioning and reachable grasp poses are left to the scene, not baked into these local meshes.  Task 13 compact OBJ exception: positions use 5 decimal metres where safe; necessary vertices retain up to 7 decimals to preserve nonzero triangles, strict collision convexity and the 0.005 mm Euclidean movement bound. Independent fixed-5 rounding cannot satisfy all three. Normals/UVs use 4 decimals; every original triangle, position index and per-corner attribute value is retained. Equal rounded UV records share indices and visual OBJ indices use shorter equivalent relative notation. No collision remeshing, reindexing or simplification. Task 13 delivery: baked albedos are Lanczos-downsampled to at most 1024 px except the unchanged-resolution factory-floor repeat tile; previews are 512 square. PNG encoding uses RGB8 or reviewed 256-colour Floyd-Steinberg palettes; source artwork pixels and source.blend are retained. Shared PNG paths resolve from this prop folder.",
